<metadata><name>Lost Lake Butte Loop</name><desc>or-vielbig-2e:116-2: route read from the book's text and sketch map. One trkseg per waypoint pair, in order; segment sources are in the trk desc. Geometry from OSM (ODbL, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors) and USFS EDW (public domain) where marked; 'straight' segments are off-trail connectors, not traced.</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="45.563099" lon="-121.666074"><ele>389.8</ele><name>Last house on Road 13</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin th:lost-lake-last-house (OSM node 8938607273 on Lost Lake Road); confidence: medium; pdf_page: 117; book_elev_ft: 1270; quote: The road from Dee is plowed 3 miles to the last house (1,270 feet)</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.532409" lon="-121.743428"><ele>551.7</ele><name>Road 13 / Road 18 (Lolo Pass road) junction</name><desc>source: OSM node 33443907 (as 115-1); confidence: high; pdf_page: 118; book_elev_ft: 1880; quote: This basin contains the junction with Road 18, the Lolo Pass road, at 1,880 feet</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.520036" lon="-121.756815"><ele>671.3</ele><name>Road 13 / Road 1340 junction (loop start)</name><desc>source: OSM node 2377671132, FR 13 and Jones Creek Road NF 1340; DEM 2,202 ft; confidence: high; pdf_page: 119; book_elev_ft: 2200; quote: Starting 6.6 miles from the last house (see map) ski onto Road 1340 at 2200 feet</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.481630" lon="-121.809690"><ele>977.7</ele><name>Saddle at 3,200 ft</name><desc>source: OSM node 3028361063, where Jones Creek Road NF 1340 tops out on the hillside south-east of the lake (DEM 3,208 ft); confidence: medium; pdf_page: 119; book_elev_ft: 3200; quote: The road then turns around the south end of Butcher Knife Ridge ... and climbs to a saddle at 3,200 feet</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.501076" lon="-121.816549"><ele>994.5</ele><name>Ticket booth (Road 13 / Road 1340)</name><desc>source: OSM node 8930181034 (as 115-1); confidence: medium; pdf_page: 119; quote: From the lake, climb to Road 13 past the ticket booth</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.520036" lon="-121.756815"><ele>671.3</ele><name>Road 13 / Road 1340 junction (loop end)</name><desc>source: as loop start; confidence: high; pdf_page: 119; book_elev_ft: 2200; quote: in 0.9 mile cross a divide, then descend 1,000 feet to Road 1340, your starting point on the loop</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.532409" lon="-121.743428"><ele>551.7</ele><name>Road 13 / Road 18 junction (return)</name><desc>source: as above; confidence: high; pdf_page: 118; book_elev_ft: 1880</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.563099" lon="-121.666074"><ele>389.8</ele><name>Last house on Road 13 (finish)</name><desc>source: as start; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 117; book_elev_ft: 1270</desc></wpt>
